-   detail
+   detail

-       `Submission[content](query)` holds the `Query` a form was submitted with, or `Unset`
-       when the form is being shown for the first time. `#value` decodes it to the form's
-       type, `#valid` says whether it decodes, and `#fresh`/`#submitted` say which state it is
-       in. With `telekinesis.forms`, `submission.form(…)` renders it as HTML.
+       `Submission[content](query)` contiene el `Query` con el que se envió un formulario, o `Unset`
+       cuando el formulario se muestra por primera vez. `#value` lo decodifica al tipo del
+       formulario, `#valid` dice si se decodifica, y `#fresh`/`#submitted` dicen en qué estado
+       está. Con `telekinesis.forms`, `submission.form(…)` lo presenta como HTML.

